'''Diana, the Mythological Pet Caretaker''', is a mayoral candidate that can be elected during the [[Mayor Election]] event. Her perks focus around [[Pets]] and [[Mythological Creature]] hunting. She sells the [[Griffin|Griffin Pet]] for {{c|25000}}, and the [[Ancestral Spade]] for {{c|5000}} and {{Item|Gold Ingot|amount=32}}s.

