== Trivia ==
*'''Diana''' is most likely based on the [[w:Diana (mythology)|Diana of Roman Mythology]], who was generally regarded as the Goddess of the Hunt. The in-game items and mayoral events seem to reinforce this, as they are primarily related to Greek and Roman mythology.
*'''Diana''' used to be the only mayor that is also a shop until {{NPCSprite|Dante}} and {{NPCSprite|Technoblade}} were elected.
*'''Diana''' was the first mayor elected in [[SkyBlock]], winning the Year 88 election with only the Mythological Ritual perk.
*'''Diana''' was also the first mayor to be elected with all 3 perks.
*'''Diana''', {{NPCSprite|Marina}}, {{NPCSprite|Cole}}, and {{NPCSprite|Technoblade}} are the only mayors to give direct stats.
*All Pet XP boosts work multiplicatively together with {{Skill|Taming}}, the [[Beastmaster Crest]], and [[Pet Items]].

